   <description>
    <narrative xml:lang="EN">In 2014, BII (then CDC Group) agreed to provide up to &#xc4;30 million to Bharti Airtel Africa as part of a &#xc4;205 million debt facility. The facility, provided by a consortium of DFIs, is helping BAA expand its telecomms provision across 17 African countries, including some of the least developed states.</narrative>
